selftext:
I had originally started a project a few years ago using Godot to build an asteroid lander game. I had designed the game loop and made some art and even some music but I never finished. 

&#x200B;

This last Friday before Fable went away I pointed it to my game folder and prompted it to rewrite it as a web application, polish it up, and add the short story narrative. It made a working game and I spent the weekend tweaking it. 

&#x200B;

I am happy to see it finally come to fruition and wanted to share. It's available at https://asteroidlander.net and playable on mobile and desktop.
